; HTML Help Workshop project for the plugin's own help pages (help/extra/): the user manual and the pragmas.
; The [FILES] section is also the list of files AhkManual copies to the temporary folder when there is no CHM.
; Compile in this directory: hhc.exe extra.hhp  ->  extra.chm
; The project lives in help/ (not in help/extra/), so that the topics inside the CHM have the same paths as in
; help/lookup/extra.txt (/extra/declare-type.htm) and the relative stylesheet link ../styles/theme.css works.
[OPTIONS]
Compatibility=1.1 or later
Compiled file=extra.chm
Contents file=extra.hhc
Index file=extra.hhk
Default topic=extra\index.htm
Display compile progress=No
Full-text search=Yes
Language=0x409 English (United States)
Title=AutoHotkey v2 Plugin

[FILES]
extra\index.htm
extra\getting-started.htm
extra\editor.htm
